  partName: Cap1
  description: The Cap2 is a tiny, elongated component positioned at the middle-center-front
    of the jet engine, constructed from Shaft1 material, which provides a secure
    seal around the engine's shaft. Its compact design enables the engine to maintain
    optimal performance while minimizing the risk of damage from external factors.
    Interestingly, the Cap2 is designed to be easily removable, allowing for convenient
    maintenance and inspection of the shaft and surrounding components.
